00:07:58.813 --> 00:07:59.745
- Drink.

00:07:59.745 --> 00:08:02.321
(laughing)

00:08:02.321 --> 00:08:04.230
Just keep going.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.917
- But you're working on
something for six months,

00:08:06.917 --> 00:08:08.310
and all of a sudden it comes out.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:10.042
- And gets dismissed.
- Yes.

00:08:10.042 --> 00:08:12.709
And then you just get harpooned.

00:08:13.799 --> 00:08:16.863
- Yeah, it's awful; yeah I hate it.

00:08:16.863 --> 00:08:20.780
And you hope that the
people enjoy what you do,

00:08:22.285 --> 00:08:26.142
